{"id": "zh-p20-0064", "text": "这套配置启动很快，但占用的内存偏多。综合来看它仍然很适合我们的测试环境，因为测试机的内存本来就比较宽裕，不值得为这点占用反复折腾。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 65, "topic_id": "p20-但启动快内存", "source_model": "deepseek-flash", "peer_session": "08176c26-e91e-46dc-b216-a61935c71231", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p20-0065", "text": "这个解析器速度很快，但依然非常严格，遇到格式错误的输入会直接拒绝而不是猜测。我们要的恰恰就是这种又快又严格的组合，所以它是合适的。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 65, "topic_id": "p20-但依然严格", "source_model": "deepseek-flash", "peer_session": "08176c26-e91e-46dc-b216-a61935c71231", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
