{"id": "zh-p20-0067", "text": "默认从镜像源安装即可，这样可以最快地拿到稳定版本。然而，如果你需要更新的特性，也可以自己从源码编译，两种方式我们都支持。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 60, "topic_id": "p20-然而源码编译", "source_model": "deepseek-flash", "peer_session": "08176c26-e91e-46dc-b216-a61935c71231", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "然而", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
